  the cert functions (461, 514, 635, 662) and the one false_trass site now
  replaced. Any additional line is a failure.
- Unit test: set up the false-trass contradiction (child var picks trass parent).
  After the contradiction fires, assert `pn.certificates["skip"].role == "untested"`
  and the skip cert record still exists (not deleted — flags, not clears).
- `python3 -m pytest -q` passes.
- Stress baseline unchanged.

