# Global acceptance invariant

For every item:

```bash
python3 -m pytest -q
python3 tests/test_form_certification.py
python3 tests/test_regime_recall.py
```

Report:
- changed files
- which behavior was supposed to change
- whether behavior changed as expected or not
- fast pytest result
- form certification test result
- regime recall result
- any delta in tareth/trass counts and explanation for the delta

An item is NOT done if it only adds terminology or data structures that nothing
reads. An item is done when a decision path reads the new structure and a test
would fail if it were removed.
